        "payload": "tree db4b7d4a5d784d2283c95903f461e311d69704c8\nparent 0af429a2ea25ecb671a5a8b5e09f6c634a277c35\nauthor Nick Schuetz <21105624+nickschuetz@users.noreply.github.com> 1791576939 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791576939 -0700\n\nEditor: remove the unused g_splashScreenState variable from CryEdit.cpp (#20196)\n\ng_splashScreenState and its ESplashScreenState enum are assigned in\nShowSplashScreen and CloseSplashScreen but never read anywhere in the tree.\nClang 23 reports the variable under -Wunused-but-set-global, which -Werror\nturns into a build failure of the Editor on Fedora 45 and rawhide.\n\ng_splashScreenStateLock stays: it still guards g_pInitializeUIInfo and\ng_splashScreen.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nick Schuetz <nschuetz@redhat.com>",
